    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AMMUNITION</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The moment you descend from the sky, the fate of the battle rests in your hands. Astrovoid\u2019s weapon crate offers you not only explosive power but also sniper scopes, silent suppressors, destructive lasers, and much more. Use the points you've earned to make your choice; every touch will change the course of the war. Strengthen your weapon or sell your old equipment to create new legends\u2014it's entirely up to you. A true Astrovoid warrior wisely uses their arsenal and builds the path to freedom with the power of their gear!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930260/extras/8d79fed0795f4d429ac7a1e06f4029e9.poster.avif?t=1742353630\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930260/extras/8d79fed0795f4d429ac7a1e06f4029e9.webm?t=1742353630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WARRIOR</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Astrovoid, you\u2019ll fight to survive in dangerous missions with your team. Whether you move as a small unit or a large squad, every decision will shape the outcome of the war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember, the enemies are ruthless, and the darkness of space shows no mercy. Keep an eye on your teammates; a wrong move could harm a friend, but true victory can only be achieved through flawless teamwork! <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930260/extras/414b1796a76d122c9b19b81fa96cb268.poster.avif?t=1742353630\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930260/extras/414b1796a76d122c9b19b81fa96cb268.webm?t=1742353630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CRUSHERS</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astrovoid\u2019s greatest threats are not ordinary foes but deadly bosses, the true masters of the battlefield. Each one can change the course of the war with unique attack patterns and ruthless tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Facing them takes courage, but the rewards are great. Plan your strategy, move as a team, and by defeating the most dangerous enemies, become a true legend. In Astrovoid, survival requires not just firepower, but brains and endurance!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930260/extras/1d9aa18831c2b74c3230c658cd8b0f23.poster.avif?t=1742353630\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930260/extras/1d9aa18831c2b74c3230c658cd8b0f23.webm?t=1742353630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FINAL ESCAPE</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mission is complete, but the real battle begins now! The enemies are on your tail, time is running out, and you have only one goal: reach the escape point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call the spaceship, set up a defense line, and fight for survival in the final battle. But remember, if some don\u2019t make it, the ones left behind will face their fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Astrovoid, victory is not just about winning the battle but surviving it! <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930260/extras/60a9f4e246d9e3afcd2c1103044797a6.poster.avif?t=1742353630\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930260/extras/60a9f4e246d9e3afcd2c1103044797a6.webm?t=1742353630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
