1103044797a6.poster.avif?t=1742353630\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930260/extras/60a9f4e246d9e3afcd2c1103044797a6.webm?t=1742353630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
